A good set of spring hooks is very useful for things like this, as well 
as for many other things. You'll go mad the first time you assemble a 
creed 7 bellcrank unit without a spring hook...

>5. Remove the amber plastic disk.
>6. Remove the felt ring.

Normally parts 4,5,6 come out together.

>7. Remove the small circlip from the shaft.
>8. Remove small black metal washer.
