Well, lets see...

First...Run and support are two different things.  As far as supported is 
concerned lets look at it from a systems perspective.

The following is the chart for Windows NT SERVER running on AlphaServers.

AlphaServer 400 - All
AlphaServer 1000/1000A - All
AlphaServer 2000 - All
AlphaServer 2100/2100A - All
AlphaServer 82/8400 - NONE

The above contain 21064's at 166/200/233/275, 21164's at 250/300


For AlphaStations, all AlphaStations support Windows NT WORKSTATION. The 
list of workstations is:

AlphaStation 200 - All
AlphaStation 400 - All
AlphaStation 250 - All
AlphaStation 500 - All
AlphaStation 255 - All
AlphaStation 600 - All

Also of note, Multia run Windows NT Workstation and Alpha XL's ONLY run  
Windows NT Workstation.

The AlphaBook does NOT run Windows NT

NO Turbochannel based systems run Windows NT!!!!

Hope this helps,

Jeff

