To find the correct address use systgen to configure your system. ie.

$MC SYSGEN
SYSGEN> CONFIGURE
SYSGEN> TU81,2           !!NOTE THE TK50 IS CONFIGURED AS A TU81.
SYSGEN> UNA              !!ETHERNET
SYSGEN> UDA              !!KDB50
SYSGEN> COMMS DEVICES MUST BE INCLUDED ETC.
SYSGEN> EXIT

This will now list the required settings etc.

Are you leaving a hole in the Qbus backplane ?


