From the R82 part, it could be an RA82.  This is a 600 MB disk
using the SDI interface.  Support disk controllers are the
KDA50, UDA50, KDB50, KDM70 and HSC family.  If it is just a
bare HDA then you're missing most of the electronics needed
to make it work with those controllers.

