Nice logic, but it doesn't hold water... Please refer to Digital 
Semiconductor's web site, url 
http://www.digital.com:80/.i/info/semiconductor/dsc-21164-pr.html
for the following statement:

"MAYNARD, Mass., March 4, 1996 -- Digital Equipment Corporation today 
announced a new version of the Alpha 21164 chip that extends its lead as the 
