|> Well, and it dispatches only 4 instructions/clock.

No, it dispatches/executes/retires 6 instructions/clock if they have
the correct mix:

        2 instructions/clock to the FXU,
        2 instructions/clock to the FPU, and
        2 instructions/clock inside the ICU which executes branches
        and condition register updates.

