If you're ever required to switch between bnc and aui on a vax, I have
a piece of hard-earned experience to pass on to you.

The switch is supposed to be pushed inwards, not to the side of the
interface you want to use.

If you attempt to push it to the side, and apply sufficent force, you
may open the box and attempt to fix the broken switch.  This is a
challenging and interesting task that will give you hours of pleasure.

-Magnus



