Memory bandwidth was a significant consideration in the design.  That
is why they decided to put a level 2 cache on the die.  There are two
8k primary caches and a 3-way set associative level 2 cache.  Also, the
data bus is 128 bits.  Bandwidth is over a Gigabyte per second maximum.

