The DZ is the serial ports.  I assume that you ran this test with a 
terminal, not the graphics head. The warning tells you that a port was 
not tested, usually because you are using it.

The TPC is the "standard" SCSI port.  It is used as a tape controller on 
this box.  You get a warning because no tape drive is connected.

Put a terminator on the Ethernet port and the NI error should go away.

