> machines to warrant a large increase in price between the VAX 4700A and 
> the VAX 4705A?

  As far as I know, the *ONLY* difference between the 4700A and the 4705A
base systems is a 3ns faster clock (18ns on the 4700A, 15ns on the 4705A
